+    // cbm fork (#1736): a lone '&' that does not begin a complete
+    // html_character_reference (`?a=1&b=2`, `Tom &Jerry`). Precedence -1 keeps
+    // html_character_reference (precedence 0) winning for `&amp;` / `&#38;`; the
